# FastAPI backend (LOCAL PDFs only):
# - Free-text client detection (aliases incl. token-set & nospace) + strict per-client retrieval
# - YAML keys are resolved to actual FAISS client ids, even if spaced/punctuated differently
# - Loads FAISS per client from local disk
# - Highlights via PyMuPDF, reading PDFs from a local "pdfs" directory
# - Lists documents from per-client manifest.json and maps them to local pdfs by filename
# - Serves local PDFs at /local-pdfs/<filename.pdf> for UIs to fetch directly

